{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Decision (2026-08-17): preserve the existing Chat Completions semantics during the pydantic-ai v2 compatibility repair by using the explicit `openai-chat:` prefix. The user approved this compatibility-preserving choice and requested a separate story for the eventual deliberate migration to `openai-responses:`."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787017351072818001,"uuid":"b5ab46a5-6596-4738-a26b-b1f3c3f6bd97"}